  "created": "2026-11-13T15:51:57.113Z",
  "description": "Tiny, fast, dependency-free PDF writer for .NET 10/11 and .NET MAUI 10/11 (Android/iOS). Subset-embedded TrueType fonts with full Unicode and kerning, Arabic shaping and the Unicode bidi algorithm for right-to-left text, kashida justification, separate Latin/Arabic fonts in one line, word wrap and flowing paragraphs, tables with page breaks, vector shapes, opacity and clipping, PNG and JPEG images (EXIF orientation), links and bookmarks. No reflection: trim- and AOT-safe.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "NkkinPdf",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-13T16:00:33.673Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "oUgSv3E63alKyl6IwFDI8GarBmAEB0IzsDWO4zkdrSBWvQs5BdXuzdSdyI1FJHFdzqBYZjn3SXJKc2A/kFGzQA==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 146579,
  "published": "2026-11-13T15:51:57.113Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "3.0.0: .NET 11 / C# 15 support, multi-targeting net10.0 and net11.0, IsTrimmable/IsAotCompatible verified, EnablePreviewFeatures for latest C# constructs, hardware intrinsics, tiered compilation. 2.0.x: full Unicode bidi algorithm (implicit levels, paired brackets, LRM/RLM/ALM), pair kerning (GPOS/kern), invisible format characters and tabs no longer draw boxes, underline/strikethrough, Justify alignment with Arabic kashida, paragraph maxLines with ellipsis, PdfDocument.DrawParagraph flows across pages. Graphics: dashed lines, ellipses, circles, polygons, PdfPath, clipping, opacity. Images: JPEG EXIF orientation, opaque PNGs embedded without decoding. Tables: per-cell styles, footer rows, vertical/outer borders, vertical alignment, page-spanning rows. Document: bookmarks, internal links, Keywords, Language, RightToLeft, CreationDate (byte-identical output), smaller font subsets. Faster: 2-14x less time and up to 75x fewer allocations.",
